        "TileImage": "$($repository a713a8a2-e203-4032-9c4a-1f8eab4c3efa).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour targets belong to a syndicate of high-ranking political officials protected by the government. The one chance you have to catch them all in the same place is at the Christmas party hosted by the governor.\r\rOur anonymous client has stated that Marv Gonif killed his father in a so-called accident, so letting him suffer before his death would be a bonus—but that is up to you.\r\rGood luck, 47!",
